          "points": 5,
          "default": "Ferocity",
          "alternatives": ["Monster Slaying/Humanoid Slaying (Survival) in Molten Core"],
          "why": "Icy Veins notes the slaying talents beat Ferocity in Molten Core if you rebuild the tree that way."
