      "notes": ["Rotation: Auto Shot with Aimed Shot / Multi-Shot woven between shots (shot-timer addon), Serpent Sting only if the debuff slot is free.", "Ranged hit cap vs. level 63 bosses is 9%; gear it before taking the Surefooted variant."],
      "sources": ["https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/hunter-dps-pve-spec-builds-talents", "https://www.wowhead.com/classic/guide/classes/hunter/dps-talent-builds-pve"]
